# Public browser variables
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Server-only Prisma variables
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@db.your-project.supabase.co:5432/postgres?sslmode=require
DIRECT_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@db.your-project.supabase.co:5432/postgres?sslmode=require

# Optional provider boundaries
MARKET_DATA_PROVIDER_URL=
SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=

Use the deployment secret manager for real values. Do not commit `.env` or service-role credentials.
